WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You'll get used to this kind of country visitor in the future

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Ask about hexagrams and don’t believe in hexagrams

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,940
They are all brothers who are here to ask for an accurate word.

4
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,940
Why do you think this is so difficult?

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:12,140
I'm already over the moon

6
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,140
Are you practicing driving or sleeping?

7
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,860
Let’s have a meal and a drink together later, daddy

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,460
Cheng, I'll treat you when you get past Kemol

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,460
Dad, I think you have a good face

10
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:29,920
From now on, if anything happens, just call me. Shroud, that’s a ghost.

11
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,520
Brother Zheng, how did you do it?

12
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:35,790
Not that bad boss

13
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:37,390
To get ahead, you have to build a team and climb mountains.

14
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:38,590
I have a fever when I come back

15
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,390
I've had a fever for two or three days, Brother Qiu

16
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:44,010
You recently had a dream about an old lady. How would you know?

17
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,700
It was many years since my grandma passed away

18
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,900
As soon as I dream, I see her staring at me not far away

19
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,300
she's right there

20
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:52,100
Staring at you fiercely
